dation/story-lead/001-current.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stderr.log\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/progress/001-story-lead.status.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/progress/001-story-lead.progress.jsonl\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/006-verify.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/streams/007-verify.stdout.log\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/streams/007-verify.stderr.log\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/001-story-validate.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/003-implementor.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/007-verify.progress.jsonl\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/007-verify.status.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/003-implementor.progress.jsonl\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/006-verify.status.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/006-verify.progress.jsonl\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/003-implementor.status.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/006-story-orchestrate-status.json\n","exit_code":0,"status